      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Triple digits 💯\n\nElectron has reached 100 launches faster than any commercially developed rocket in history. With another 100+ launches in backlog, we're just getting started.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
